  "_meta": {
    "description": "Reference data for breed- and size-adjusted dog-to-human age conversion.",
    "sources": [
      "Wang, T. et al. (2020) 'Quantitative Translation of Dog-to-Human Aging by Conserved Remodeling of the DNA Methylome.' Cell Systems 11(2), 176-185. (epigenetic formula, calibrated on Labrador Retrievers)",
